  "summary": "Lightwell Security Advisory: jakarta.mail 1.6.7.rhlw-00001",
  "details": "Red Hat Lightwell has released com.sun.mail:jakarta.mail 1.6.7.rhlw-00001 with a backported security fix.\n\nCVE-2025-7962: In Jakarta Mail versions prior to 2.0.2 it is possible to perform an SMTP Injection by utilizing the\u00a0\\r and \\n UTF-8 characters to separate different messages.\n\nThis patched artifact is a drop-in replacement for com.sun.mail:jakarta.mail 1.6.7 from Maven Central.",
